  "prefLabel": "Pda 606.05 Annual Berthing Permit Initial Applications; When Fee Returned",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 606.05 Annual Berthing Permit Initial Applications; When Fee Returned. Any person holding a pier use permit and seeking an annual berthing permit shall submit a completed initial annual berthing permit application form in accordance with Pda 606.04. If the division determines that there are no berthing locations available, the division shall return the applicant’s initial application form and annual berthing permit application fee, and the applicant may file an annual berthing permit wait list application in accordance with Pda 605.\n\nSource. #8321, eff 10-1-05; ss by #10441, eff 11-1-13; ss by #13806, eff 11-17-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pda100-700.html"
